%N A400519 Number of equivalence classes of n X n binary matrices under cyclic permutations of rows and columns and complementation of all entries.
%C A400519 The acting group is C_n X C_n X C_2, of order 2*n^2.
%F A400519 a(n) = (1/(2*n^2))*Sum_{d|n} Sum_{e|n} phi(d)*phi(e)*(1 + [lcm(d,e) even])*2^(n^2/lcm(d,e)).
%e A400519 For n = 2, the four pairs (d,e) = (1,1), (1,2), (2,1), (2,2) contribute 16, 8, 8, and 8, respectively. Hence a(2) = (16 + 8 + 8 + 8)/(2*2^2) = 5.
%Y A400519 Cf. A179043 (without complementation of all entries).
%K A400519 nonn,new
%O A400519 1,2
